SY_TALK("mo69F5MuS-E",[[4324,["I bow to all the seekers of truth."]],[4334,["When you seek truth,"]],[4341,["how dynamic one can become,"]],[4343,["you can see the way these artists are,"]],[4347,["how the blessings of the truth helps you"]],[4351,["in your self confidence and in the expression of your art."]],[4357,["And also you must have seen how the people from the West,"]],[4363,["who have had no training in Indian music which is very difficult,"]],[4366,["how they have taken easily to it."]],[4369,["In the same way the Indians have taken to Western music very easily."]],[4376,["The reason is,"]],[4379,["we have to understand what we are."]],[4384,["And that is the truth one has to know."]],[4387,["The truth is that you are the Spirit."]],[4393,["You are not this body, this mind,"]],[4397,["this ego, emotions,"]],[4402,["but you are the Spirit."]],[4406,["Until you become the Self, Spirit,"]],[4409,["you cannot feel the All-Pervading Power,"]],[4414,["which is very subtle."]],[4417,["And this is another truth one has to realize,"]],[4421,["that this Power exists"]],[4425,["and it does all the living works,"]],[4434,["it organizes, it thinks,"]],[4439,["above all it loves you."]],[4443,["But when I say this,"]],[4447,["you have to have an open mind of a scientist."]],[4452,["If, what I am saying, like a hypothesis,"]],[4459,["turns out to be true,"]],[4462,["then you have to accept it in all your honesty."]],[4478,["The most important thing today"]],[4480,["is to ask a question to ourselves,"]],[4483,["”Why are we here? What is the purpose of our coming?”"]],[4489,["If we ask such a question"]],[4492,["then only a new search towards the truth will start."]],[4498,["And these two things that I have told you,"]],[4501,["that you are the Spirit"]],[4504,["and that you have to be in connection with this All-Pervading Power,"]],[4511,["will have to work it out for you"]],[4514,["because then you become the seekers of truth. It's your right."]],[4518,["So Sahaja means - ‘Saha’ means born with you."]],[4521,["With - ‘Saha’ is with, ‘Ja’ is born."]],[4525,["So born with you is the right"]],[4528,["to be united - that is ‘Yoga’ - with this Divine Power."]],[4532,["This is the real meaning of ‘Yoga’ -"]],[4534,["is that you are to be united with that Divine Power."]],[4540,["The manifestation of this, when it happens,"]],[4545,["you become a beautiful personality that you are."]],[4551,["You become that glory that you are."]],[4554,["And you rise into a new state"]],[4557,["that we call as of ‘collective consciousness’."]],[4562,["This is the process of your evolution."]],[4568,["And this is the last breakthrough of our evolution,"]],[4571,["where from human awareness you have to become"]],[4576,["a realized soul, a person who is born again."]],[4581,["Like the birds are also called as ’dvijaha’ in Sanskrit language,"]],[4586,["meaning 'those who are born again';"]],[4589,["meaning, first they come as eggs"]],[4591,["and then they are born as birds. In the same way,"]],[4594,["it has to happen to you."]],[4596,["And once these things happen,"]],[4599,["so many manifestations come through"]],[4604,["and we get the beautiful blessings of this All-Pervading Power."]],[4613,["The first thing that happens to you,"]],[4615,["is that physically you feel fit."]],[4618,["You feel fit with your own powers."]],[4621,["No medicines are needed."]],[4624,["No maneuvering is needed. Nothing is needed. You just,"]],[4627,["from your own power, which is lying in the triangular bone here."]],[4632,["Have you talked to them something about it? No, it is not. Just..."]],[4635,["All right. In the triangular bone this Power lies"]],[4640,["which is called as Kundalini."]],[4643,["I think it is too far away for them to see."]],[4646,["Can it be brought, can we bring it forward?"]],[4651,["They can’t see it, so what's the use?"]],[4665,["Now all of you can see it?"]],[4669,["SY: This side. This side. Here."]],[4671,["SM: It would be better? All right, this side."]],[4675,["Can you see now?"]],[4680,["Just this way a little bit. These are all Sahaja Yogis, aren’t they?"]],[4683,["So, it is all right, for you need not see. You just put it this..."]],[4687,["Just little at an angle, please."]],[4690,["Yes, now is better? All right."]],[4694,["So, this subtle system exists within us."]],[4698,["And we have to understand this subtle system."]],[4701,["Like all our civilizations has grown outward, like a tree."]],[4705,["And whatever we have knowledge through science or any other method,"]],[4710,["is the knowledge of the tree."]],[4712,["But we have no knowledge of our roots."]],[4714,["And that is why we are always under a threat of a shock"]],[4720,["and God knows what's going to happen to us."]],[4723,["If we know our roots,"]],[4725,["then we know how to nourish this tree very well."]],[4729,["Now here you see in the triangular bone, is this Power,"]],[4734,["what we call as Kundalini in a Sanskrit word,"]],[4736,["but ‘Kundal’ means coils,"]],[4738,["coiled up into three and a half coils."]],[4741,["And this Power is the residual power within us"]],[4746,["which is waiting for that moment when it can be awakened."]],[4751,["And like you have now connected by this cord to the mains,"]],[4755,["this Power rises and connects you to the mains."]],[4760,["By that you become a subtler personality,"]],[4763,["you become that collective conscious personality,"]],[4766,["you go beyond thoughts."]],[4768,["And as I told you, physically, mentally and emotionally"]],[4773,["you become absolutely a perfect personality."]],[4777,["Apart from that, you achieve your peace of mind,"]],[4782,["all your tensions disappear"]],[4784,["and that you become a witness."]],[4788,["Like a witness you see the play, the play of the Divine,"]],[4793,["and the complete knowledge of the Divine and the subtle knowledge,"]],[4799,["becomes your own; which is an absolute knowledge."]],[4803,["Everybody who is in Sahaja Yoga knows the same thing."]],[4808,["There is no argument, there is no fight,"]],[4812,["there is no discussion."]],[4815,["Because once you get this Realization,"]],[4817,["when this Kundalini rises and passes through"]],[4820,["six subtle centers above,"]],[4823,["then you start feeling on your finger tips,"]],[4827,["the cool breeze of the Holy Ghost, as they call it,"]],[4830,["or we can say the All Pervading Power."]],[4834,["Also you can feel the cool breeze, out of your fontanel bone area"]],[4839,["when this Kundalini pierces through,"]],[4841,["and that is the actualization of baptism."]],[4847,["Is not artificial"]],[4849,["that somebody puts the finger on your thing and say,"]],[4852,["\"Now you are baptized.\""]],[4853,["Baptism is a living process"]],[4858,["and it's a living process of evolution"]],[4862,["that gives you this new dimension to your awareness."]],[4869,["Now the rising of the Kundalini is spontaneous"]],[4874,["because it's a living process. Like if you have a seed,"]],[4878,["it sprouts if you put it in the Mother Earth, spontaneously."]],[4883,["We don’t have to stand [on] our heads"]],[4886,["or to read some sort of a book or a scripture."]],[4889,["It just happens."]],[4891,["In the same way, spontaneously,"]],[4894,["this power rises and connects you to the mains."]],[4898,["As a result, as I told, you become dynamic,"]],[4901,["you become extremely creative,"]],[4905,["you feel very young, you work very hard, you don’t feel tired"]],[4910,["and so many diseases automatically get cured by your own power,"]],[4915,["by yourself."]],[4916,["Nobody has to cure you. You just get absolutely cured out of it."]],[4921,["For example, we have so many problems in the modern times,"]],[4927,["of very different nature:"]],[4931,["that people are overactive"]],[4933,["and over activity takes them away from reality"]],[4937,["and they become sort of slaves of over activity."]],[4941,["This is done by the second center which is, you see, the yellow, the bile."]],[4946,["This center is, for example,"]],[4949,["I will tell you about one center at least today,"]],[4951,["That this center is called as Swadisthana center"]],[4955,["and which looks after, on the physical side,"]],[4960,["and caters for aortic plexus."]],[4963,["And this center has got a very important work to be done,"]],[4967,["is to convert the fat for the replacement"]],[4973,["of the grey cells of our brain."]],[4977,["This is a very important work for people who are futuristic,"]],[4981,["who are planning all the time, who are thinking too much."]],[4984,["As a result all other functions of this center are neglected."]],[4989,["And these other functions are, that it has to cater to your liver."]],[4994,["Now liver has a job,"]],[4996,["it has to transform the heat or the poison from your body,"]],[5002,["as heat into the blood stream"]],[5005,["so that it is thrown out."]],[5009,["But when this center is busy"]],[5013,["doing something else, so important,"]],[5016,["this work is left undone or sometimes very much neglected."]],[5021,["As a result one develops a bad system of liver."]],[5025,["This liver creates heat,"]],[5028,["does not throw out the heat from the body"]],[5031,["which passes along and you get so many complications with it,"]],[5036,["like asthma and others."]],[5040,["Today we had a patient who came and she had the same problem."]],[5044,["And she said, \"They have told me I have some viruses, this, that\","]],[5048,["all kinds of diagnosis she told Me."]],[5051,["I said, \"Nothing, you just have liver,"]],[5053,["and you just try to improve your liver, you will be all right\"."]],[5057,["Within ten minutes she said, \"I'm feeling all right\"."]],[5060,["I said, \"That's it."]],[5062,["You have a liver problem. So this virus is there,"]],[5064,["that virus is there, all kinds of roundabout ways of saying"]],[5068,["to show that it is absolutely incurable\"."]],[5072,["Now, then you go from there"]],[5076,["to another very important work, is that of the pancreas"]],[5080,["which looks after or caters of dissolving your sugar."]],[5087,["But when you have this pancreas in a mess,"]],[5091,["because this center is not looking after it,"]],[5096,["then you develop a horrible disease called diabetes."]],[5100,["And this diabetes only happens to people"]],[5102,["who sit down and think too much, who plan too much,"]],[5105,["mostly to bureaucrats,"]],[5108,["and maybe to politicians, I don’t know."]],[5112,["But say in India, farmers ask for sugar"]],[5117,["and if you give them tea, the sugar should be so much"]],[5122,["that the spoon should stand at right angles, you see."]],[5125,["Otherwise they'll think, \"This is no tea, this is horrible!\""]],[5130,["And despite all that, they never get diabetes."]],[5135,["But any bureaucrat who is too much of a planner"]],[5139,["or a politician or someone like that, who thinks too much,"]],[5144,["gets it even with one spoon,"]],[5146,["maybe with the half spoon he gets diabetes."]],[5148,["So this is due to the fact that this poor center"]],[5153,["has to do some work for all these people"]],[5156,["who are extra active with their brains"]],[5159,["and other organs like pancreas, are neglected."]],[5166,["Then third one is even more important, more dangerous is the spleen."]],[5170,["The spleen is the one, which is, we can say,"]],[5174,["is the one which keeps the rhythm of life."]],[5176,["As you have seen the rhythmic work, it keeps the rhythm of life."]],[5180,["Now this rhythmic work,"]],[5184,["if we do not allow it to work with proper rhythm"]],[5187,["and we have become hectic,"]],[5189,["then this center has the job to create"]],[5194,["red blood corpuscles for the use of any emergencies."]],[5201,["Supposing you have taken your food and suddenly you want to run,"]],[5206,["then you get a pain here"]],[5208,["and you don’t know why you are getting the pain."]],[5210,["Because that time your spleen goes into action in a very frantic way"]],[5215,["and produces more RBCs, red blood corpuscles"]],[5218,["and with that, it has to work hard, you get that pain."]],[5224,["Now when you lead such a hectic life, all the time under shocks,"]],[5229,["like early in the morning we read the newspapers;"]],[5232,["one shock is sufficient."]],[5234,["Then secondly you have to have your breakfast,"]],[5238,["you can’t have time, you are in a busy, you are running away to work"]],[5241,["and on the way you find there is a jam."]],[5243,["Then you go, your boss also shouting at you for getting late,"]],[5248,["all kinds of time bound things, you see."]],[5250,["All these plays upon your spleen,"]],[5255,["and poor spleen doesn’t understand"]],[5257,["what sort of a personality is this one; is so hectic."]],[5260,["God knows, it requires red blood corpuscles now and then"]],[5264,["and like that, is so hectic, there is no rhythm about it..."]],[5267,["so it gets, you should say, crazy."]],[5271,["Then it becomes vulnerable, absolutely vulnerable"]],[5275,["for a disease called blood cancer."]],[5279,["Then at the same time,"]],[5282,["if on the left side there is some triggering done, triggering"]],[5286,["due to some shock or some sort of pain or unhappiness"]],[5289,["or something like that,"]],[5291,["this disease sets in."]],[5293,["Now people who have come to Sahaja Yoga, were certified"]],[5297,["to be dead within eight days also by doctors,"]],[5301,["who have suffered from this trouble,"]],[5303,["got themselves cured of blood cancer."]],[5306,["Cancer is also cured with it, no doubt."]],[5308,["But it is cured automatically by your own powers."]],[5312,["Nobody has to cure you. You just get cured by your own powers."]],[5316,["Once you get your Realization,"]],[5318,["and you know how to handle your own powers,"]],[5320,["how to treat yourself,"]],[5322,["first you can find out what is wrong with your centers,"]],[5325,["diagnosis is there,"]],[5326,["and you can find out also how to get it cured."]],[5329,["You can cure yourself"]],[5331,["and you can help others to get their Realization."]],[5334,["This is the power you get."]],[5336,["It is not just a certificate, a false certificate,"]],[5339,["that, \"I am a self-realized person, I am a twice-born person.\""]],[5350,["It has to be a certificate from yourself"]],[5355,["that you have to feel the cool breeze."]],[5358,["You have to feel that All Pervading Power."]],[5361,["You have to feel your peace and your silence within yourself."]],[5367,["So first of all when the Kundalini rises,"]],[5369,["She passes through this center"]],[5372,["which we call as Agnya,"]],[5374,["which is placed in the optic chasma."]],[5378,["When this passes through that it sucks in from both the sides,"]],[5382,["these two institutions which are created"]],[5385,["by our left and right sympathetic nervous system."]],[5388,["Whenever there is an emergency, the sympathetic goes into action."]],[5392,["So here we have an autonomous nervous system."]],[5396,["Autonomous nervous system is named by doctors."]],[5399,["We have to ask them, \"What do you mean by auto?"]],[5402,["Who is this 'auto'? Who does this job?\""]],[5404,["So we have left and right side of autonomous nervous system"]],[5408,["nourished by these two channels, left and right."]],[5411,["And when this autonomous nervous system starts working"]],[5414,["either on the desire side"]],[5417,["or we can say emotional side, on the left hand side,"]],[5420,["it creates an institution here, which we call as superego,"]],[5424,["or in Sanskrit called as ‘Mana’,"]],[5427,["where all our conditionings are stored up."]],[5429,["And on the other side, if the right side is too much excited,"]],[5436,["if a person is too much futuristic"]],[5438,["and is using too much his mental and physical capacities,"]],[5442,["then there is another institution"]],[5444,["that is created on top of your head,"]],[5446,["which we call as ‘ego’."]],[5450,["These two meet and sometimes overlap"]],[5453,["and so we close our fontanel bone area"]],[5457,["which was a soft bone in your childhood."]],[5461,["So when this Kundalini passes through this center"]],[5464,["which we call as Agnya Chakra,"]],[5467,["it sucks in these two institutions. So your karmas are sucked in"]],[5471,["and your conditionings are sucked in"]],[5474,["and it comes down like this, it opens this area,"]],[5478,["Kundalini pierces through this."]],[5481,["Now this is a spontaneous thing happening."]],[5484,["It is not that you have to do something about it."]],[5487,["As the car starts, all the machinery starts working,"]],[5490,["this also starts working."]],[5493,["But, in... say, \"This is modern Raja yoga is there,"]],[5496,["Hatha yoga is there\", everybody ask Me question after the lecture,"]],[5500,["so it is better I tell you about it already,"]],[5502,["that this so called Raja yoga is something"]],[5505,["like when the car has not yet started,"]],[5510,["the machinery won’t start."]],[5512,["So without starting the car you start moving the wheels"]],[5514,["is the modern's Raja yoga."]],[5517,["They even cut the tongues of, I mean"]],[5519,["not the tongues but the threads of the tongues of people,"]],[5523,["to push back the tongue,"]],[5525,["so that it can stop the Kundalini."]],[5529,["But when the Kundalini is rising by itself, it stops."]],[5534,["It stops every area it crosses through."]],[5539,["Supposing it comes to this area, then when it passes through it,"]],[5543,["it has to go into an augmentation, into constriction"]],[5548,["to stop that Kundalini falling down."]],[5551,["So it is done automatically."]],[5553,["As we eat our food it gets digested, in the same way it happens."]],[5557,["But artificially it is not to be done."]],[5560,["And all these artificial doing is of no help."]],[5564,["Same about Hatha yoga. Is ‘ha´-`tha’, is two words there,"]],[5568,["meaning the sun line and the moon line,"]],[5571,["meaning the left and the right side channel, both are to be used."]],[5574,["But when we do Hatha yoga in the modern times,"]],[5577,["we are just trying to do only physical exercises"]],[5580,["which is a very wee, wee part of the Patanjali yoga,"]],[5584,["out of which Hatha yoga has come."]],[5587,["In the Patanjali yoga is described that"]],[5590,["you have to see a person who has got problems on his physical side."]],[5594,["Supposing now somebody has had an accident or something"]],[5597,["and the back bone is not all right and there is a problem on that."]],[5602,["So you have to correct it."]],[5604,["But this correction is the best once the Kundalini is up,"]],[5607,["so you know where is the problem"]],[5609,["and then is to be corrected scientifically."]],[5612,["Not to be done in a haphazard manner."]],[5614,["And sometimes the people do Hatha yoga in the way,"]],[5617,["that as if they are taking all the medicine boxes together,"]],[5621,["without any discrimination."]],[5623,["So you should have discrimination about it"]],[5625,["and you should find out what’s wrong"]],[5628,["and then do exactly whatever is needed to be done."]],[5632,["Not to do everything blindly."]],[5634,["So the first thing, the blessings of Sahaja Yoga is"]],[5637,["that you get to know all the knowledge."]],[5640,["It is not just you say this mantra,"]],[5642,["you do this thing, you do, nothing of that kind."]],[5644,["You first become the Spirit."]],[5648,["And you know everything about it, what it is."]],[5651,["You experience it, you find out for yourself, you certify yourself"]],[5655,["and then you have to work it out."]],[5659,["So it is a very practical, pragmatic thing."]],[5662,["Of course you can’t pay for all these things."]],[5665,["Those who are paying for this must know is a wrong thing,"]],[5667,["because it's a living process."]],[5669,["For a living process how can you pay?"]],[5672,["It's something absurd but people don’t understand"]],[5675,["that you cannot pay for it"]],[5678,["because they don’t feel confident"]],[5679,["if you don’t have to pay for something."]],[5681,["The other day I was in Cairns,"]],[5684,["and there is a Sahaja Yogini and she said, \"Mother,"]],[5687,["they wouldn’t come to a program for which you don’t have to pay.\""]],[5691,["\"So then, what did you do?\""]],[5693,["She said, \"I told them I will take 50 dollars from you.\""]],[5696,["They all came with 50 dollars, quite happy and satisfied."]],[5700,["So she took 50 dollars from them,"]],[5702,["gave them Realization, worked it out"]],[5705,["and then she returned the money saying,"]],[5708,["\"I don’t need this money, sorry.\""]],[5711,["But this kind of a psychology, I can’t understand"]],[5714,["that we are so much used to payment in everything"]],[5717,["that we cannot understand one thing, that"]],[5720,["Divine doesn’t know what is payment is."]],[5723,["How much do we pay for this Mother Earth for sprouting everything,"]],[5726,["for giving us beautiful trees and things?"]],[5729,["How much did we do for Her that we have to pay for it?"]],[5732,["But this is something we don’t understand in the West."]],[5735,["In India they do because they know"]],[5737,["that Divine has no sense of money."]],[5741,["It doesn’t know banking, doesn’t know insurance,"]],[5744,["nothing of the kind."]],[5745,["And this is what we have to understand first of all"]],[5748,["that if we have to become a divine personality,"]],[5752,["we must respect it as a pure thing."]],[5756,["It doesn’t need any money, it doesn’t need anything."]],[5759,["It just needs one thing which is the pure desire within you,"]],[5764,["because this is the power of pure desire,"]],[5767,["the desire that, \"I have to become one with the Divine.\""]],[5771,["All other desires are impure,"]],[5774,["because no desire when fulfilled, gives you satisfaction."]],[5778,["You jump from one desire to another desire."]],[5782,["That’s why it is said in economics that in general"]],[5786,["the desires and wants are not satiable."]],[5789,["But this is the desire that we have."]],[5792,["And once this desire is fulfilled,"]],[5794,["we become absolutely contented, satisfied"]],[5799,["and a complete balance is established within ourselves."]],[5803,["All these ecological problems settle down"]],[5807,["because the imbalance in the human beings itself"]],[5811,["creates the imbalance outside."]],[5814,["Whatever are human problems are projected outside."]],[5818,["These are not problems"]],[5820,["which have come from nature, but are created by us."]],[5823,["Because of our problems these problems arise."]],[5827,["So somehow if we can manage to put ourself in proper line,"]],[5832,["everything will be fine and we will live in a new era of,"]],[5838,["what we call the Golden Age,"]],[5841,["and we enter into the Kingdom of God."]],[5843,["Because then you will realize, yourself experience"]],[5846,["that every moment is so surprising,"]],[5849,["how it works out, how things just help you"]],[5854,["and how you manage to get over difficulties without any trouble!"]],[5859,["It is something so wonderful, so fantastic!"]],[5862,["And is sometimes people will be skeptical about it."]],[5865,["They will think how can that be?"]],[5867,["But supposing there is a television set"]],[5870,["I take it to the ignorant people in our Indian villages"]],[5874,["and show them and say that"]],[5875,["\"You can see all kinds of films in this one\","]],[5877,["They will say, \"What, this box! How can it show?\""]],[5880,["So we treat ourselves as that box."]],[5882,["But actually when you put it to the mains,"]],[5884,["you know how fantastic it is."]],[5886,["So, we are not created just for nothing."]],[5889,["We are created for a special work,"]],[5891,["only thing is we have to know our Self."]],[5893,["And all the scriptures and religions have said ‘know thy self’."]],[5898,["But all of them have gone astray, absolutely astray,"]],[5902,["they have become all man-made sort of things."]],[5906,["And that is why people are in complete disillusionment about them."]],[5911,["But whosoever created them,"]],[5914,["all those great prophets, incarnations"]],[5918,["are absolutely truthful people and they told the truth."]],[5922,["All the saints were truthful people."]],[5925,["And we have to learn from them"]],[5927,["and we ourselves have to become saints."]],[5930,["We don’t have to give up our families,"]],[5932,["we don’t have to do all this nonsensical things which are outside."]],[5935,["The detachment works out within yourself."]],[5937,["Everything works out within yourself"]],[5939,["and I am sure today, in Brisbane,"]],[5942,["we'll be achieving it for all of you."]],[5944,["Because modern Sahaja Yoga is an en masse happening."]],[5950,["Formerly, only one or two people used to get Realization;"]],[5953,["on the tree of life there were only one or two flowers."]],[5957,["But today I call it a blossom time."]],[5959,["And also this is the Day of Judgment,"]],[5962,["where we judge ourselves."]],[5964,["In the Koran it is said that your hands would speak"]],[5967,["and you will judge yourself."]],[5969,["But even the Muslims are not following what He said,"]],[5973,["even the Christians are not following what Christ has said,"]],[5976,["even the Hindus are not following what their Scriptures have said."]],[5979,["They are all having a nice"]],[5981,["money-oriented or power-oriented organization."]],[5986,["That is not going to help us."]],[5988,["We have to have the Reality, the Truth."]],[5991,["It is for our benevolence,"]],[5994,["for the benevolence of our children,"]],[5996,["for the benevolence of the whole world."]],[5998,["That is how the whole humanity has to emancipate."]],[6001,["And that's what I am here to tell you about."]],[6005,["May God bless you all!"]],[6011,["We are rather time bound because they told Me"]],[6016,["that your conveyance is a problem here"]],[6019,["and that I should finish everything before 9.30."]],[6023,["So I have to tell you one thing that if you could"]],[6028,["ask Me some questions that you have, relevant questions,"]],[6031,["because I am not here to take anything from you."]],[6034,["I am here just to tell you what you are"]],[6036,["and to see that you get what you have."]],[6039,["So if you have any relevant questions,"]],[6041,["please ask Me for a few minutes."]],[6045,["And then we will have the session for Realization"]],[6048,["that will take about ten minutes."]],[6050,["So I'll be very happy if you could ask Me questions about it."]],[6054,["One thing I have to say and excuse Myself"]],[6058,["that in a one-day lecture,"]],[6061,["I cannot cover the whole subject."]],[6063,["It is an ocean of knowledge."]],[6066,["And this ocean of knowledge can be understood better"]],[6069,["when you have Self Realization,"]],[6071,["the light of your Spirit in your attention."]],[6074,["You will understand it much better."]],[6077,["But there are My lectures, so many, thousands of them"]],[6080,["in English language itself."]],[6082,["So you can listen to them also."]],[6084,["But first, the best thing is to get your Realization."]],[6088,["For example there are so many lights here"]],[6091,["and when you come in"]],[6092,["what you do is to just switch on and the whole thing comes up."]],[6096,["But supposing I have tell you everything about the electricity,"]],[6100,["the discovery of electricity, then how it was brought here,"]],[6103,["and in Brisbane how it was arranged, it will be a headache."]],[6106,["So best is to get the lights"]],[6108,["and then we'lll know more about the knowledge of it."]],[6112,["May God bless you!"]],[6123,["M: I would like to know how to perform meditation."]],[6129,["SY: He'd like to know how to perform meditation."]],[6131,["SM: It's good question. That is what I am going to do now."]],[6134,["You do not do meditation"]],[6137,["but you are in meditation."]],[6140,["It is a state. It is a state in which you rise,"]],[6143,["where you become thoughtlessly aware to begin with."]],[6146,["You are aware but there is no thought."]],[6149,["And whenever you want to think, you will think,"]],[6151,["otherwise you can stop your thoughts. That is first state."]],[6154,["And the second one is called as doubtless awareness"]],[6158,["where you have no doubts left about it"]],[6160,["and you just become so powerful"]],[6163,["that you can give Realizations to others,"]],[6165,["you can do so many things, which normally you could have never done."]],[6169,["These two states are to be achieved."]],[6172,["So we don’t have to do meditation as such,"]],[6175,["it just will work out. You will be in meditation."]],[6181,["L: Can you put it [louder]? I am not hearing You..."]],[6184,["SY: Not hearing very well?","L: No, I am not."]],[6187,["SY: Do you hear [unclear]?"]],[6192,["SM: What is it?"]],[6195,["What is it?"]],[6196,["SY: The speakers, there is a noise in the speakers and I want to see..."]],[6201,["SM: There is a noise on? Some sort of a noise ..."]],[6205,["Next time we will have better arrangements for you."]],[6210,["But whatever may be the problem,"]],[6212,["you will get your Realizations all right."]],[6223,["What is it?"]],[6226,["SY: She wants me to give you another mike or something."]],[6229,["Is not good?"]],[6240,["SY: She wants to know, does reincarnation affect individual spirits?"]],[6245,["SM: Individual spirits?"]],[6250,["I didn't...","SY: That is the question. Could you...?"]],[6253,["L: You know, about rebirth, do we all reincarnate?"]],[6256,["Do we all have another life?"]],[6258,["SY: Do we all reincarnate?"]],[6259,["SM: Of course. No doubt."]],[6263,["You see you must logically understand."]],[6266,["Now supposing you were in a certain century"]],[6272,["and you had committed some mistakes, supposing,"]],[6276,["or you have done something good,"]],[6279,["or you were searching something,"]],[6282,["you were wanting something."]],[6285,["Then, I mean,"]],[6287,["you are not going to be condemned by one life, isn’t it?"]],[6292,["Because God Almighty is the ocean of forgiveness"]],[6297,["and He loves you"]],[6299,["and He wants you to enter into the Kingdom of God."]],[6302,["So He gives you more chances."]],[6304,["I will tell you one thing that we had a driver"]],[6309,["and he was a very quiet and very stately personality."]],[6314,["And he told Me that he has become a driver"]],[6321,["because in last life he must have been some king"]],[6325,["and the king must have been over burdened with work."]],[6329,["So the king must have thought is better to be a driver"]],[6333,["and there is no burdening of this,"]],[6335,["\"So, I have become a driver and very happy about it\"."]],[6340,["In the same way, you see, things can happen"]],[6342,["that you are searching for something."]],[6344,["Like somebody wants to marry some lady."]],[6346,["I mean is just mad"]],[6349,["and he suffers from Greek tragedy you can call it,"]],[6351,["and goes into a kind of a nonsensical ideas,"]],[6354,["doesn’t love his wife and just thinks of another woman all the time,"]],[6359,["and thinks that, \"I should get married to her\"."]],[6362,["So the next life, the Divine says, \"All right, have her!\""]],[6366,["And then he says, \"Oh, God! What a wife! Better run away.\""]],[6370,["So he learns a lesson."]],[6372,["So it is like giving lessons in your different lives."]],[6376,["Is very important"]],[6377,["because God is not going to just damn you like that,"]],[6380,["that you are good for nothing, is not going to stamp you like that."]],[6384,["Is a wrong idea."]],[6385,["And because Christ also has said, \"I will come again\"."]],[6388,["If He had not believed in reincarnation why did He say that?"]],[6394,["Very irrelevant."]],[6406,["It has, you see in the, between the lines you must be able to read."]],[6410,["And that is the problem is that, between the lines we cannot read"]],[6414,["because we are not realized souls."]],[6416,["Once we are realized souls"]],[6418,["we start seeing everything between the lines."]],[6421,["Otherwise we cannot understand."]],[6423,["And the whole thing becomes superficial"]],[6425,["and people who are interested only in money building and all that"]],[6429,["start some sort of a wrong idea"]],[6431,["and we get absolutely deluded by them."]],[6448,["M: What is the place of Christ in them? What is [the relation]?"]],[6454,["SM: What is the...?"]],[6456,["SY: He said where is Christ in this set up and what is the relation?"]],[6459,["SM: On the Agnya, on the Agnya chakra.","M: But what is the relation?"]],[6464,["SM: You see because He is on the optic chiasma"]],[6467,["which we, sometimes people call it \"a third eye\"."]],[6470,["He is on the Agnya chakra."]],[6472,["Now what I am saying is - you can verify it on your vibrations -"]],[6476,["because when the Kundalini rises"]],[6478,["and She comes up to the Agnya chakra,"]],[6480,["you have to say Lord’s prayer."]],[6483,["And that’s how He has died for our sins."]],[6487,["He has died for our sins means, He, once He is awakened,"]],[6491,["that all our conditionings and all our ego is sucked in."]],[6496,["He is a very, very important gate through which we have to pass."]],[6501,["He said “I am the gate”."]],[6502,["He didn’t say, \"I am the destination\", but \"I am the gate\"."]],[6506,["Very clear."]],[6507,["Christ's life you cannot understand"]],[6509,["unless and until you have your Realization. Not at all."]],[6512,["Through these priests and all that, you cannot understand it at all."]],[6515,["Specially, Mr. Paul, I don’t know how he appeared in the scene,"]],[6519,["because he himself was epileptic"]],[6522,["and some sort of an experience he had,"]],[6525,["and this spoiling Christianity has","been criticized by so many people."]],[6528,["Recently I read a book written by a very good German priest"]],[6534,["when Christ was in India,"]],[6536,["and he has absolutely condemned Paul in Christianity;"]],[6540,["he said he has brought all kinds of things"]],[6543,["which are not relevant to Christ."]],[6545,["Then also there was a book written by Thomas"]],[6550,["who was travelling to India"]],[6552,["and on his way he stopped in Egypt"]],[6554,["where he wrote lot of treatises"]],[6557,["and also wrote about what Christ had said it"]],[6560,["and was kept in a big jar."]],[6563,["And he called all these people who followed Christ, as ‘gnostics’."]],[6567,["Gnostics - those who know, ‘Gna’."]],[6569,["‘Gna’ word comes from the word ‘jnana’."]],[6571,["‘Jnana’ means to know on your central nervous system."]],[6574,["Is also in Buddhist thing, is called as ‘ Boddha’."]],[6578,["‘Buddh’, ‘ Boddha’ is to know on your central nervous system."]],[6582,["And also, say in the Hindu scriptures is called as ‘vida’"]],[6588,["means from where the word ‘Veda’ comes,"]],[6590,["that you have to know on your central nervous system."]],[6593,["Now, this book has been now after 48 years,"]],[6597,["it has been now decoded and found out and"]],[6600,["there was a very nice program on this."]],[6603,["And it was all challenging, all these ideas of Paul in Christianity."]],[6608,["You don’t have to suffer. He said, \"Why should you suffer?\","]],[6611,["because God Almighty is the Father of all the fathers,"]],[6615,["and why should we ask you to suffer?"]],[6617,["Christ has already suffered for you."]],[6619,["Now, you are not going to suffer more."]],[6621,["So many things like that and also about Sahaja Yoga,"]],[6624,["that it’s a spontaneous experience which must be experienced"]],[6628,["and must be felt on the central nervous system."]],[6632,["He said so clearly, on your nerves, as he said it."]],[6636,["So, this book has been written down"]],[6639,["and is known as \"The Gnostics\"."]],[6641,["If you can get hold of it, please go through it."]],[6643,["It’s a wonderful book which will give you full idea"]],[6646,["as to what Thomas wrote about."]],[6648,["And these people were called as ‘Gnostics’."]],[6651,["They were not called as Christians,"]],[6653,["but ‘Gnostics’ means the ones who have known."]],[6655,["Known what? Known, not through your brains,"]],[6658,["but known on your central nervous system."]],[6660,["As in Sanskrit language is called as ’Gynanis’."]],[6670,["M: Could You tell us a bit more about the rising of the Kundalini,"]],[6674,["when this Kundalini rise, can we make Kundalini rise?"]],[6678,["Is it dangerous [unclear]?"]],[6682,["SY: Could You tell us some more about Kundalini. Is it dangerous to rise?"]],[6686,["SM: No, not at all. This [part], I should have covered Myself."]],[6690,["Not at all, is never dangerous, you see."]],[6693,["It’s your Mother. She is your individual Mother."]],[6697,["When you were born your mother took all the labor pains upon herself."]],[6701,["She didn’t give you any pain."]],[6703,["In the same way She is your Mother"]],[6706,["and that’s a Mother energy, that is the primordial Mother"]],[6709,["which is reflected in you."]],[6710,["That’s the Holy Ghost. They didn’t talk of Mother"]],[6713,["but they said it is a dove."]],[6715,["I don’t know why they said it,"]],[6717,["but this is the Primordial Mother, no doubt."]],[6719,["Because you have the God, the Father,"]],[6722,["God the Son,"]],[6724,["and what about the Mother?"]],[6726,["That's the Holy Ghost. It is a mystery."]],[6728,["It's no mystery for us."]],[6730,["You will know that the Holy Ghost is nothing else"]],[6733,["but the Primordial Mother called as ‘Adi Shakti’"]],[6736,["and by so many names."]],[6738,["Like here is the river, is called as ‘Parramatta’,"]],[6740,["is the Primordial Mother. Is a absolutely a Sanskrit word."]],[6744,["`Parramatta´ is absolutely Sanskrit word"]],[6747,["saying Primordial Mother [Param Mata]."]],[6750,["So this Mother is not going to give any trouble to you whatsoever."]],[6756,["And those who say so, because they do not know how to do it,"]],[6759,["they want to frighten you and keep you away from reality."]],[6764,["They have no authority. If they had divine authority,"]],[6767,["if they had some ways and methods of saying so,"]],[6770,["they would have said so."]],[6772,["Like many people also say that the time has also not come."]],[6774,["Because they don’t know how to do it."]],[6778,["That’s why they are postponing it. It is very selfish, I should say,"]],[6782,["or all self-opiniatedness that to say that this is so and this is so."]],[6787,["The Kundalini of course will never trouble you."]],[6790,["But if you try wrong methods"]],[6793,["then naturally there is a heat in the body"]],[6795,["and the deities get angry with you,"]],[6797,["the innocence gets angry and tortures you."]],[6802,["These false gurus who have come all over,"]],[6804,["I am ashamed of them and they are the ones"]],[6807,["who have mesmerized and taken money from you."]],[6809,["I mean how can they take money from you"]],[6811,["and how can they be your gurus when they are taking"]],[6814,["all this kind of money from you? Just think of it."]],[6817,["They are just you have retained them,"]],[6819,["they are like your servants I should say."]],[6821,["They have no self respect."]],[6827,["All right, you can pay for this hall all right."]],[6829,["But you can’t pay for your Self Realization."]],[6843,["L: Do You teach a system of [unclear] the chakras"]],[6849,["is necessary and do You describe [unclear]."]],[6855,["SY: Do You teach a method of cleansing the chakras?"]],[6859,["SM: Of course, of course.","L: [unclear] SM: Of course."]],[6864,["We have a very good center here"]],[6866,["and we have very capable Sahaja Yogis,"]],[6869,["those who know how to cleanse your own chakras and everything."]],[6874,["Of course, that's the minimum."]],[6878,["And you yourself will be equipped with it."]],[6881,["You yourself will know all these things."]],[6886,["All that will be done. Is not just this lecture."]],[6890,["There is a follow on. Please, all of you should come."]],[6893,["It is not only Me, they also know everything"]],[6896,["and you will also know everything. That’s how it is going to spread."]],[6899,["Like one enlightened light enlightens another"]],[6902,["and then that enlightened light enlightens another person."]],[6906,["They are very very equipped here. They know everything about it."]],[6909,["They have My lectures and things also."]],[6911,["The main thing is they know everything"]],[6913,["and you have to know everything yourself."]],[6921,["L: May I just ask You, humans don't carry the burden of original sin?"]],[6928,["SY: Do we still carry the burden of original sin?"]],[6931,["SM: No, not at all. It’s over now. Time is over."]],[6935,["The original sin only brought us to ignorance"]],[6938,["and we started searching ourselves."]],[6940,["Otherwise things would have been much better"]],[6942,["if we had not gone into it."]],[6943,["But whatever it is, is now"]],[6945,["you had to come through a very circuitous way to understand."]],[6949,["Because human beings, you see, as they were at that time, also"]],[6953,["wanted to find out about themselves."]],[6955,["So God said, \"All right, you have this freedom.\""]],[6959,["Only human beings have the freedom, not the animals."]],[6962,["Animals are called as ‘Pashu’ means they are under bond,"]],[6964,["they are under the bondage of God,"]],[6967,["and is already all controlled by Him."]],[6970,["For example a scorpion is a scorpion, snake is a snake,"]],[6974,["they keep to their own dharma, means their own valences,"]],[6977,["their own religion, we can call it."]],[6979,["They don’t change. But human beings can be a scorpion,"]],[6983,["can be lion, can be tiger, can be anything."]],[6987,["They just shoot out like Jack in the box, you know."]],[6990,["Sometimes you don’t know what’s the matter"]],[6992,["now suddenly from where it is coming?"]],[6994,["Is interesting, isn’t it?"]],[6996,["But then once you are realized you see it as drama,"]],[6999,["and you just see that whole thing is just working out"]],[7003,["in a very funny manner."]],[7005,["You don’t take it so seriously as we normally do."]],[7007,["And you just enjoy everything."]],[7010,["And by your own countenance, by your own temperament,"]],[7013,["by your own character, people change."]],[7016,["And they ask, \"How are you like this?\""]],[7018,["Then you say that \"We have become Sahaja Yogis,"]],[7022,["so they come to you and they become Sahaja Yogis, too."]],[7025,["It's a wonderful area, it's a wonderful time"]],[7028,["and such wonderful people all over the world."]],[7030,["Like I went to USSR, you will be surprised, USSR."]],[7034,["And I never expected, they never have heard of any God or anything,"]],[7038,["and Christ also, they were just keeping Him aloof."]],[7042,["And there it is the people,"]],[7044,["thousands they came and they got Realization,"]],[7046,["settled down into them, very deep people."]],[7048,["They touched their depth. I was amazed. But the best part of it,"]],[7052,["that the Germans went to give them Realization."]],[7055,["25 Germans rushed there, to help Me out. I was amazed, you see."]],[7060,["And I said, \"It must have cost you\" , but they said, \"Mother,"]],[7063,["what is the money for? We have to come for Russians\"."]],[7066,["And such love and such understanding, you see."]],[7070,["I was really touched by their beauty."]],[7072,["Can you imagine Germans giving Realization to Russians?"]],[7078,["So beautiful it is to see their beauty expressing itself."]],[7086,["Yes.","SY: One raised at the back."]],[7090,["M: [unclear]."]],[7094,["How it will, what it represents [unclear]?"]],[7098,["How is it the divine state?"]],[7100,["And [unclear] what is guiding us now?"]],[7105,["And is it possible that some people have"]],[7108,["without particular effort [unclear]."]],[7111,["SM: What is he saying?"]],[7138,["What is he talking?"]],[7140,["M: Mother, if rising Kundalini is what [unclear] ,"]],[7143,["how would You describe the current state?"]],[7146,["And what is it that is driving us now?"]],[7150,["SM: Driving you?"]],[7151,["SY: No, he said Kundalini is the [unclear] thing."]],[7154,["Then Kundalini rises and that's how we wake up all of them,"]],[7159,["and that Realization [rises], Mother."]],[7161,["What is the current state and what about the state are we [now]?"]],[7164,["SM: No, you are at a state which we call as human awareness at its best."]],[7168,["When you start thinking \"Why am I here on this earth?\","]],[7173,["you are trying to find out, because you see many things"]],[7177,["which do not satisfy you and you think this is not absolute."]],[7181,["Why there are so many opinions about everything?"]],[7184,["Why people think differently?"]],[7186,["And all these things come to your mind."]],[7188,["then you become what we call as a seeker of truth."]],[7192,["Is that is the state, is ‘Sadaka’ and that seeking brings you here."]],[7196,["And then you get your Realization."]],[7198,["Those who are not seekers, I cannot force it on anyone."]],[7202,["It has to work out, only on seekers."]],[7204,["Those who just want to sort of test it and things like that"]],[7208,["doesn’t work out. Those who are really seeking the truth, it works out."]],[7211,["I am sorry, it cannot be guaranteed for everyone."]],[7214,["If you are really seeking the truth, it works out,"]],[7216,["otherwise it does not."]],[7219,["So these are..."]],[7220,["This is the capacity in which you are here to seek the truth."]],[7224,["All right?"]],[7230,["L: Could Mother talk on intellect and Self Realization"]],[7233,["and part that intellect plays [as part of the] Self Relaization."]],[7239,["SY: What part does intellect play in the Self Realization?"]],[7243,["SM: After Realization, if you are really intelligent,"]],[7246,["in the way I would say that, detached intelligent,"]],[7249,["then you see it much better than anybody else."]],[7253,["Because you see it and you are honest,"]],[7255,["you see that this is what is happening."]],[7258,["And you are surprised. And you learn things much faster than others."]],[7262,["So, I call it, it is a person who has a super intelligence, I call it,"]],[7267,["intelligence which has already reached a state to see"]],[7271,["that this is not true, this is not true."]],[7273,["You reach a point when you know this is not true."]],[7275,["That is the point you hit the right thing."]],[7277,["So intelligence is very helpful."]],[7280,["And you will be surprised, we have Sahaja Yogis,"]],[7282,["most of them, of very intelligent..."]],[7286,["They are first class, first of this university,"]],[7288,["first class, first of that university, I mean all of them are there."]],[7291,["So you meet a person who has that sharp intelligence"]],[7294,["to see things also."]],[7296,["Also a person who is not so intelligent,"]],[7300,["but is so dedicated and is so loving,"]],[7304,["so purely loving people out of just love that is in,"]],[7307,["such people are also very good."]],[7309,["But in any case you don’t first judge yourself,"]],[7311,["that is the first point. You are not to judge,"]],[7313,["your Kundalini knows you very well."]],[7315,["So please don’t judge yourself, let your Kundalini judge you."]],[7319,["Now should we have now the session for...?"]],[7321,["SY: It's just one question.","SM: One more? Yes, say..."]],[7324,["M: Is that [unclear] of the yoga before... hatha yoga?"]],[7328,["Could you speak on Kriya Yoga?"]],[7330,["SM: Same thing, Kriya Yoga is the same, which I told you or Raja."]],[7335,["Sahaja Yoga is ’a-Kriya’ yoga."]],[7336,["‘Kriya’ means when you do something is ‘Kriya Yoga'"]],[7339,["and “A-Kriya’ yoga is Sahaja Yoga."]],[7343,["I don’t do anything."]],[7344,["Without doing anything it works out, is the point."]],[7347,["But, of course, you have to know your centers,"]],[7349,["you have to know how to nourish them, that is different."]],[7352,["But ’Kriya’ yoga is something as I've told you,"]],[7355,["is just like ‘Raja yoga’."]],[7357,["Without starting the Kundalini,"]],[7359,["you start sort of moving your chakras and things,"]],[7362,["it doesn’t work out."]],[7365,["That's it."]],[7367,["It has reached nowhere. You see, you must see the results."]],[7370,["You must see the results."]],[7372,["First of all when you go to any one of them,"]],[7374,["first you must see those who have been there,"]],[7377,["and see what is their capability, how they are."]],[7381,["Unless and until you see them,"]],[7383,["why should you go to those people?"]],[7387,["Because they claim something, you shouldn’t."]],[7390,["You must find out what are their disciples like? How are they?"]],[7393,["What sort of people they are? What have they achieved?"]],[7395,["And then go there. As a Mother, I would say"]],[7397,["what, what has these gurus given you? Nothing."]],[7400,["They have made you broke."]],[7403,["You have... so many are bankrupt, so many are sick,"]],[7406,["so many people are sick."]],[7407,["This Rajnish’s disciples are so sick, you don’t know."]],[7410,["When they come to Me, first they faint."]],[7412,["I get so frightened with them."]],[7414,["They faint, actually. You see, I'm really frightened, poor things."]],[7423,["Horrible diseases have been created by them,"]],[7425,["and some people have got blood cancer from them."]],[7428,["All kinds of things have happened."]],[7430,["Is all very bad type of mesmerism,"]],[7432,["which you will know what it is later on."]],[7435,["So those who have been to these gurus also are suffering today."]],[7438,["You pay to get sick. Can you imagine?"]],[7450,["And you are all seekers, you see, that's My concern."]],[7453,["So every seeker has a right to get his yoga."]],[7455,["Every seeker has a right. No doubt."]],[7459,["But if you are not seeking, I cannot force on you. I cannot."]],[7464,["I respect your freedom. If you want you can go to heaven,"]],[7467,["if you want you can go to hell. It is very simple."]],[7471,["One boy asked Me, \"How do you go to hell?\""]],[7473,["I said, \"You take two running jumps and you are there.\""]],[7478,["What a question to ask?"]],[7481,["When I am talking of heaven, he is asking about hell."]],[7484,["So, I said this is what it is."]],[7491,["Now, finished I think."]],[7494,["Now, madam, again."]],[7496,["I think... Can we postpone it now?"]],[7499,["All right. You see what I am saying all these questions,"]],[7502,["even if I answer - because I'm very good at answering every question"]],[7505,["and I don’t have to think about them -"]],[7508,["but that answer is not sufficient."]],[7511,["You have to get your awakening."]],[7513,["That is not sufficient to satisfy you. It is not going to work out."]],[7518,["You have to get it, is the point. All right?"]],[7527,["Now as I have told you, those who do not want to have it,"]],[7531,["should please leave the hall."]],[7534,["There is no problem on that. I will never feel bad about it,"]],[7537,["because also you must know there's"]],[7541,["no force can be done."]],[7544,["Those who really want it should be here and should oblige."]],[7548,["That's being very civil."]],[7554,["Those people who are standing can sit here and they... yes..."]],[7582,["SY: [Shri Ma] should we put the air-conditioning off?"]],[7585,["Should we put the air-conditioning off so that is clear it's not..."]],[7589,["SM: No, I mean, they won’t doubt it."]],[7592,["SY: Just mention it."]],[7596,["SM: If you want we can put off the air conditioning"]],[7599,["because then you should not doubt"]],[7601,["that you got cool breeze out of your head."]],[7604,["After all your head is giving the cool breeze,"]],[7606,["that doesn’t mean the air conditioning"]],[7608,["is coming through your head, isn’t it?"]],[7617,["Actually, you see, people doubt"]],[7619,["because they don’t know what to expect."]],[7621,["But for us it is very easy to understand,"]],[7625,["because already described what to expect after Self Realization,"]],[7629,["is described by Adi Shankaracharya"]],[7632,["‘salilam’, ’salilam’, is the cool breeze."]],[7634,["Also cool breeze of the Holy Ghost is described in the Bible,"]],[7637,["also described the tree of life, which is this one."]],[7640,["So many things, but you see, is not so clear cut."]],[7643,["As it is Christ had very little time to talk to people."]],[7647,["I mean, just imagine He was crucified."]],[7650,["How much time they gave Him to talk publicly?"]],[7652,["I am the only one who has outclassed all, lots of things."]],[7656,["Because now I am 67 and nobody lived like Me for so many years."]],[7662,["They just finished Him off at a very early age."]],[7666,["That is the trouble. Nobody understood them."]],[7668,["No saint has lived as long as I have lived so far, somehow."]],[7679,["All right."]],[7683,["So a simple thing is,"]],[7686,["first I must tell you the conditions, two conditions."]],[7691,["First one is"]],[7694,["that you are not to feel guilty at all."]],[7698,["You have to forget the past."]],[7701,["You have to be in the present."]],[7704,["Forget the past, forgive yourself."]],[7709,["Because, as I told you, the Divine is the ocean of forgiveness"]],[7714,["and you cannot do anything that cannot be forgiven"]],[7717,["by that greatness of forgiveness."]],[7724,["So please, forgive completely yourself"]],[7728,["and know that you are not guilty at all."]],[7731,["Supposing you were guilty,"]],[7732,["you would have been in jail. Why are you here?"]],[7735,["So now don’t jump on to small, small things,"]],[7738,["which you think is creating guilt."]],[7740,["So not to feel guilty at all, first point."]],[7746,["The second one is that you have to forgive everyone."]],[7749,["Just forgive every one. Not to think whom to forgive,"]],[7753,["why to forgive, what they have done to you."]],[7755,["But just to forgive them, logically to understand is"]],[7759,["that whether you forgive or don’t forgive,"]],[7762,["you don’t do anything."]],[7764,["Whether you forgive someone or don’t forgive,"]],[7767,["you don’t have to do anything about it."]],[7770,["But if you don’t forgive then you play into wrong hands."]],[7774,["I mean actually you are playing into the hands"]],[7777,["who wanted to trouble you."]],[7779,["So when you forgive, that person is out of your mind"]],[7782,["and no tortures anymore left."]],[7784,["So you have to forgive and this is what is the teaching of Christ,"]],[7788,["if you remember, that \"forgive them those who trespass against us"]],[7792,["for we forgive them those who trespass against us\"."]],[7796,["This is a very great weapon Christ has given us."]],[7799,["So from your heart you must just forgive everyone."]],[7803,["These are the only two conditions we have."]],[7811,["All right."]],[7813,["So another thing is that we have to take help of the Mother Earth."]],[7817,["So would be nice if we can take out our shoes at least,"]],[7820,["and keep them on one side."]],[7833,["It is such a truth that we have so many Jews now"]],[7837,["who worship Christ"]],[7839,["and so many Hindus who worship Mohammad Sahab."]],[7844,["Such a truth."]],[7852,["Complete integration."]]]);
